    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You date back to the days of Rome. You have seen the birth of the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} itself. There is nothing a group of neonates can do that can impress you, surprise you, upset you or even slow you down. Your derangement is something you indulge away from work. When you are performing the role of justicar, Malkav's curse never shows. When you arrive in a city, it is for only one reason&mdash;something has gone terribly, terribly wrong. Use whatever tools you have to put things right again, be they political, social or supernatural. Then leave as soon as you can. No matter how bad things are, the Kindred should fear your arrival and look forward to your departure.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Clan:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZJx9H3XnU8yQGy9s]{Malkavian}<br><strong>Nature:</strong> Autocrat<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Perfectionist<br><strong>Generation:</strong> 6th</p><p><strong>Physical (16):</strong> Athletic, Brawny, Quick x3, Resilient x3, Tough x2, Steady x3, Wiry x3<br><strong>Social (18):</strong> Charismatic x3, Commanding x3, Dignified x3, Intimidating x6, Persuasive x3<br><strong>Mental (17):</strong> Attentive x3, Determined x6, Disciplined x2, Knowledgeable x3, Observant x3</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Athletics 4, Brawl 3, Dodge 5, Firearms 4, Intimidation 3, Law (Kindred) 5, Leadership 3, Lore (Camarilla) 5, Lore (@UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat}) 4, Melee 4, Politics 4, Subterfuge 2</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Auspex (Heightened Senses, Aura Perception, Spirit's Touch, Telepathy); Celerity (Alacrity, Swiftness, Rapidity, Legerity); Dementation (Passion, The Haunting, Eyes of Chaos, Voice of Madness, Total Insanity); Fortitude (Endurance, Mettle, Resilience); Obfuscate (Cloak of Shadows, Unseen Presence, Mask of a Thousand Faces, Vanish from the Mind's Eye, Cloak the Gathering)</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Contacts x5, Resources x4, Herd x2<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 2, Self-Control 3, Courage 2<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 2<br><strong>Derangement:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.derangements.JournalEntry.54b2022695f143c1]{Sanguinary Animism}<br><strong>@UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.rules-reference.JournalEntry.St7uVm2DqK4nRy8X]{Status} (5):</strong> Acknowledged, Faultless, Feared, Just, Revered<br><strong>Blood:</strong> 30 (may spend 6/round)<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 16</p>",
